[C1] PASS causes are ORed over ranks into bits 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32: rank flags -> causes = 37 (floor limiter vic-solve); every rank sees the same mask
[C2] PASS a step that always fails is tried 1 + max_redo times, the last at dt/32, then the run stops: dt factors 1, 0.5, 0.25, 0.125, 0.0625, 0.03125; decisions [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, -1]
[C3] PASS an accepted step resets the redo count, so the next step starts at the full bound: after 3 redos and an acceptance: current_redo = 0, factor = 1
[C4] PASS past max_redo a VIC solve failure (32) still restores the step; other causes stop without it: restores: floor-only 5, vic-solve 6, of 6 attempts
[C5] PASS a nonzero vapour-repair count sets the limiter flag (4), so the step is redone, not raised: causes: vapour alone 4, vapour and a floor on one of two ranks 5, none 0; decisions [1, 0]
